┌────────────────────────────────Suzumushi Help────────────────────────────────┐
│Navigation                                                                    │
│  Tab or Shift+Tab     focus Library, Player, or Queue                        │
│  Up or Down, j or k   move the selection                                     │
│  Home or End, g or G  jump to the first or last item                         │
│                                                                              │
│Library and search                                                            │
│  /                     search artist, title, filename, and path              │
│  Enter                 add the selection and play when idle                  │
│  Esc                   close search                                          │
│                                                                              │
│Queue                                                                         │
│  J or K                move the selected item down or up                     │
│  d or Delete           remove item    c clear Queue                          │
│                                                                              │
│Playback                                                                      │
│  Space                 play or pause    s stop                               │
│  n or p                 next or previous                                     │
│  Left or Right          seek back or forward five seconds                    │
│  - or +                 volume down or up    m mute                          │
│  x                     shuffle    r repeat                                   │
│                                                                              │
│  ? or Esc               close help    q quit    Ctrl+c quit anywhere         │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
